pan><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕320;\">신청서 및 응모작은 반환하지 않으며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕320;\">수상작의 저작권은 당사에 귀속됩니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕320;\">신청자 수 및 작품퀄리티에 따라 수상내역은 변동될 수 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕320;\">본 공모전에 출품된 작품은 저작권법에 위배되지 않아야 하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕320;\">이전에 발표하지 않은 순수창작물이어야 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">5. </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕320;\">배경음악과 폰트의 경우</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕320;\">저작권에 제한이 없어야 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">6. </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕320;\">초상권 및 저작권 문제가 발생할 경우 모든 책임은 제작자에게 있으며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕320;\">타 공모전의 수상작 또는 타인의 저작물을 도용한 경우</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕320;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;심사에서 제외됩니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">7. </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕320;\">상금은 팀 참여의 경우 팀 리더에게 지급하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕320; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: -윤고딕320;\">제세공과금은 수상자 부담입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacin